	<item>
		<title>Contact</title>
		<link>https://queendorfashionhouse.com/contact/</link>
		<pubDate>Sun, 02 Nov 2026 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[queendor]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://queendorfashionhouse.com/?page_id=9105</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>We are a small team in Accra and we answer our own messages. Email is fastest;
if it is urgent, call.</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th></th>
<th></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong>Email</strong></td>
<td><strong>[EMAIL ADDRESS]</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Phone / calls</strong></td>
<td><strong>[PHONE NUMBER]</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Address</strong></td>
<td><strong>[STREET ADDRESS], [AREA], Accra, Ghana</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Opening hours</strong></td>
<td><strong>Monday–Friday, [9:00–17:00] · Saturday, [10:00–14:00]</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Instagram</strong></td>
<td><a href="https://www.instagram.com/queendor_fashionhouse/">@queendor_fashionhouse</a></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>We reply to emails within <strong>one working day</strong>, and usually much sooner. If you have
not heard from us in two working days, please call — it means the email did not
reach us.</p>
<h3>What to include in your message</h3>
<p>So we can help in one reply rather than five, please include:</p>
<ul>
<li>your <strong>order number</strong>, if your question is about an order (it is in your
  confirmation email, and looks like <code>#1234</code>);</li>
<li>the <strong>email address or phone number</strong> you used to order;</li>
<li>a <strong>photograph</strong>, if something arrived damaged;</li>
<li>the <strong>date</strong> you need a piece by, if it is a gift.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Common questions first</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Where is my order?</strong> Check the tracking message we sent when it was dispatched.
  If tracking has not moved for two working days, write to us.</li>
<li><strong>Can I return or exchange something?</strong> Yes, within 7 days — see <em>Returns and
  Refunds</em> below for the exceptions.</li>
<li><strong>Do you deliver outside Accra?</strong> Yes, by courier, across Ghana.</li>
<li><strong>Can I order for a shop or buy in bulk?</strong> Yes — see <em>Wholesale</em> below.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Order problems</h3>
<p>If an order is wrong, damaged or late, email <strong>[EMAIL ADDRESS]</strong> with your order
number in the subject line and we will deal with it. Please do not open a payment
dispute before contacting us — most problems are a courier delay we can fix in a
day, and a dispute can take weeks.</p>
<h3>Wholesale and stockist enquiries</h3>
<p>We supply boutiques and stockists across Ghana. Minimum order is <strong>6 pieces per
style</strong>, at <strong>50% of the retail price</strong>, boxed and retail-ready. Tell us your shop
name, where you are, and which pieces you are interested in, and we will send trade
terms. You can also read the <em>Wholesale</em> page first.</p>
<h3>Press, collaborations and custom work</h3>
<p>We do take on custom and small-batch work. Email us with what you have in mind,
your quantity and your date, and we will tell you honestly whether we can do it.</p>
<h3>Visiting us</h3>
<p>[Choose one and delete the other:
<strong>We do not have a shop you can walk into — everything is dispatched by rider or courier. Our address above is for returns and correspondence.</strong>
/ <strong>You are welcome to visit us at [ADDRESS] during opening hours. Please message before coming so someone is there to meet you.</strong>]</p>
<hr />
<p><strong>Queen Dor's Fashion House</strong> · [REGISTERED BUSINESS NAME] · Registration
<strong>[NUMBER]</strong> · [ADDRESS], Accra, Ghana</p>
<hr />]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
